l units, we buy every type: <strong>Split AC, Window AC, Cassette, Package, Central, Portable, Chiller, Car AC, Ductable, Panel, Tower, and Inverter ACs.</strong>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section><section class=\"repair-services-section\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<h2>Is Your AC Repairable? Don&#8217;t Scrap It Just Yet!</h2>\r\nBesides buying old units, we are experts in AC repair. A quick fix might save you money! Explore our top services.\r\n<div class=\"service-cards\">\r\n<div class=\"service-card\">\r\n\r\n<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/AC-Chemical-Wash-Deep-Cleaning-in-Vadodara.webp\" alt=\"AC Chemical Wash and Deep Cleaning in Vadodara\" title=\"\">\r\n<h3>AC Jet Cleaning Service</h3>\r\n<p class=\"price-tag\">Starting at ₹499</p>\r\nRestore cooling efficiency and air quality with our power jet wash.\r\n\r\n<a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn-service\" href=\"https://atlasaircons.com/ac-repair-in-vadodara.html\">Learn More</a>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"service-card\">\r\n\r\n<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/emergency-ac-repair-in-vadodara.webp\" alt=\"Emergency AC Repair Service in Vadodara\" title=\"\">\r\n<h3>Emergency AC Repair</h3>\r\n<p class=\"price-tag\">Inspection at ₹299</p>\r\nAC not cooling? Making strange noises? Our team is ready for emergency fixes.\r\n\r\n<a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn-service\" href=\"https://atlasaircons.com/ac-repair-in-vadodara.html\">Book Now</a>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"service-card\">\r\n\r\n<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/advance-panel-ac-repair-service.webp\" alt=\"AC PCB and Panel Repair in Vadodara\" title=\"\">\r\n<h3>AC PCB Panel Repair</h3>\r\n<p class=\"price-tag\">Get Quote</p>\r\nSpecialized repair for complex inverter and non-inverter AC circuit boards.\r\n\r\n<a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn-service\" href=\"https://atlasaircons.com/services/other-repairing/hvac-system-services.html\">Get a Quote</a>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"service-card\">\r\n\r\n<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/ac-repair-service.webp\" alt=\"Comprehensive HVAC System Services in Vadodara\" title=\"\">\r\n<h3>Full HVAC System Service</h3>\r\n<p class=\"price-tag\">Contact for Price</p>\r\nComplete solutions for large-scale HVAC, Chiller, and Central AC systems.\r\n\r\n<a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn-service\" href=\"https://atlasaircons.com/services/other-repairing/chiller-repair-services.html\">Explore Services</a>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section><section class=\"pros-cons-section\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<h2>Selling vs. Repairing Your Old AC: What&#8217;s Best for You?</h2>\r\n<div class=\"pros-cons-columns\">\r\n<div class=\"column\">\r\n<h3>Pros of Selling Your Old AC</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n \t<li>✅ <strong>Instant Cash:</strong> Get immediate money for an unused item.</li>\r\n \t<li>✅ <strong>Space Saving:</strong> Free up valuable balcony or storage space.</li>\r\n \t<li>✅ <strong>Eco-Friendly:</strong> We ensure responsible recycling of parts and gases.</li>\r\n \t<li>✅ <strong>Upgrade Fund:</strong> Use the cash towards a new, energy-efficient model.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"column\">\r\n<h3>Cons of Selling (When to Repair)</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n \t<li>❌ <strong>Minor Issues:</strong> Could be a cheap fix like a capacitor or gas top-up.</li>\r\n \t<li>❌ <strong>Relatively New:</strong> If less than 5 years old, a repair is often more cost-effective.</li>\r\n \t<li>❌ <strong>Sentimental Value:</strong> Sometimes, it&#8217;s just hard to let go!</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"conclusion\"><strong>Our Honest Advice:</strong> If your AC is over 8-10 years old, requires a major component replacement (like a compressor), or is